              <br />
              <br />
              <strong>
                <a href="https://www.prisonlegalnews.org/">Prison Legal News</a>
              </strong>
              <br />A monthly publication of American legal cases relevant to
              jailhouse lawyers
              <br />
              <br />
              <strong>
                <a href="http://www.tgijp.org/">TGIJP</a>
              </strong>
              (San Francisco, USA)
              <br />A group by and for (formerly) incarcerated trans women of
              colour
              <br />
              <br />
              <strong>
                <a href="http://tranzmissionprisonproject.yolasite.com/">
                  Tranzmission Prison Project
                </a>
              </strong>
              (Asheville, USA)
              <br />
              Support group for LGBTQQIA prisoners
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
